  "_comment": "Where to read the SAME version of each Bible of the tracker on trustworthy sites, to check a doubtful verse (the criteria step). Researched on 2026-10-21. match: exact = same edition; probable = same translation, the edition is not confirmed (good to separate glued words, not enough alone to replace a verse: a second source or the other copy must agree); orthography = same translation in another spelling (only to confirm words exist). Every request is cached in packs/_cache and spaced by min_interval_s: never fetch a whole Bible.",
